        "answer": {
          "short": "$2x+3y-9=0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m_{AB}&=\\frac{7-1}{4-0}\\\\m_{AB}&=\\frac32\\end{align*}$$\nThe altitude through $C$ has gradient $-\\frac23$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y+1&=-\\frac23(x-6)\\\\3y+3&=-2x+12\\\\2x+3y-9&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
