        "answer": {
          "short": "$y=3x-5$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m_{AC}&=\\frac{-1-1}{6-0}\\\\m_{AC}&=-\\frac13\\end{align*}$$\nThe altitude through $B$ has gradient $3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y-7&=3(x-4)\\\\y-7&=3x-12\\\\y&=3x-5\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      },
