        "answer": {
          "short": "$x-4y+4=0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m_{BC}&=\\frac{-1-7}{6-4}\\\\m_{BC}&=-4\\end{align*}$$\nThe altitude through $A$ has gradient $\\frac14$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y-1&=\\frac14(x-0)\\\\4y-4&=x\\\\x-4y+4&=0\\end{align*}$$",
